-- ============================================================================
-- CoachOS — complete database initialisation
--
-- Generated by scripts/build-schema.sh from supabase/migrations/*.sql.
-- Run this once, top to bottom, in the Supabase SQL editor to set up a
-- fresh project. It is equivalent to applying every migration in order.
--
